  "bio": "Elias Papadopoulos is a highly skilled neotraditional tattoo artist based in Arnhem, Netherlands. With a professional demeanor, Elias operates out of the Barberstation Arnhem, and also frequently travels for guest spots at other esteemed studios. Clients rave about the attention to detail in his work and his commitment to maintaining a clean and sterile environment, ensuring a safe and exceptional tattooing experience.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Arnhem, Gelderland, Netherlands\n\nWorking @ various guest spots. For guest spots Check 👇🏻   Phone/What’s App 0620034905 and info@tattoosbyopa.com   Jezus is 👑🙏🏻",
